<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
<title>OrionPath — Orientación vocacional para estudiantes</title>
<meta name="description" content="OrionPath ayuda a estudiantes a explorar áreas profesionales, carreras y universidades de Paraguay mediante recursos de orientación vocacional.">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#040607">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Syne:wght@400;600;700;800&family=DM+Sans:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;1,300&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<style>
:root{--periwinkle:#E3D9FC;--magenta:#9d4cc2;--blue:#4928C2;--velvet:#5B2A62;--black:#040607;--white:#f8f4ff}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{background:var(--black);color:var(--periwinkle);font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;overflow-x:hidden}
#stars-canvas{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;pointer-events:none;z-index:0}
nav{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:1.2rem 3rem;background:rgba(4,6,7,.7);backdrop-filter:blur(16px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(191,64,250,.15);transition:all .3s}
.nav-logo{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:1.5rem;color:var(--white);letter-spacing:-.02em}
.nav-logo span{color:var(--magenta)}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:2rem;list-style:none}
.nav-links a{color:var(--periwinkle);text-decoration:none;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.7;transition:opacity .2s,color .2s}
.nav-links a:hover{opacity:1;color:var(--magenta)}
.hamburger{display:none;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;padding:4px}
.hamburger span{display:block;width:24px;height:2px;background:var(--periwinkle);border-radius:2px;transition:all .3s}
.mobile-menu{display:none;position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:rgba(4,6,7,.97);z-index:99;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:2.5rem}
.mobile-menu.open{display:flex}
.mobile-menu a{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-size:2rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--periwinkle);text-decoration:none;transition:color .2s}
.mobile-menu a:hover{color:var(--magenta)}
.mobile-close{position:absolute;top:1.5rem;right:2rem;background:none;border:none;color:var(--periwinkle);font-size:2rem;cursor:pointer}
section{position:relative;z-index:1;padding:7rem 2rem}
#hero{min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;padding:0 2rem;overflow:hidden}
.hero-eyebrow{font-size:.75rem;letter-spacing:.25em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--magenta);margin-bottom:1.5rem;opacity:0;animation:fadeUp .8s .3s forwards}
.hero-title{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(3.5rem,12vw,8rem);font-weight:800;line-height:.92;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:var(--white);opacity:0;animation:fadeUp .8s .5s forwards;margin-bottom:.3rem}
.hero-title .accent{color:var(--magenta)}
.hero-subtitle{font-size:clamp(1rem,2.5vw,1.3rem);color:var(--periwinkle);opacity:0;animation:fadeUp .8s .7s forwards;max-width:520px;margin:1.5rem auto 2.5rem;line-height:1.6;font-weight:300}
.hero-cta{display:inline-flex;gap:1rem;opacity:0;animation:fadeUp .8s .9s forwards;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center}
.btn-primary{padding:.9rem 2.2rem;background:var(--magenta);color:var(--black);font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:.9rem;letter-spacing:.04em;border:none;border-radius:100px;text-decoration:none;transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s;cursor:pointer;display:inline-block}
.btn-primary:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 0 32px rgba(191,64,250,.5)}
.btn-outline{padding:.9rem 2.2rem;border:1.5px solid rgba(191,64,250,.5);color:var(--periwinkle);font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem;letter-spacing:.04em;border-radius:100px;text-decoration:none;transition:border-color .2s,color .2s;cursor:pointer;display:inline-block;background:none}
.btn-outline:hover{border-color:var(--magenta);color:var(--magenta)}
.scroll-indicator{position:absolute;bottom:2.5rem;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;opacity:0;animation:fadeIn 1s 1.5s forwards}
.scroll-indicator span{font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.4}
.scroll-line{width:1px;height:48px;background:linear-gradient(to bottom,var(--magenta),transparent);animation:scrollPulse 1.5s ease-in-out infinite}
.section-label{font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--magenta);margin-bottom:1rem;opacity:.8}
.section-title{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.5rem);font-weight:800;color:var(--white);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-bottom:1.5rem}
.section-desc{font-size:1rem;line-height:1.7;color:var(--periwinkle);opacity:.75;max-width:560px}
.divider{width:60px;height:2px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--magenta),transparent);margin:1.2rem 0 1.8rem}
#about{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:5rem;align-items:center;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto}
.about-visual{position:relative;height:380px}
.orion-ring{position:absolute;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(191,64,250,.2);animation:spin linear infinite}
.orion-ring:nth-child(1){width:200px;height:200px;top:90px;left:80px;animation-duration:20s}
.orion-ring:nth-child(2){width:300px;height:300px;top:40px;left:30px;animation-duration:35s;animation-direction:reverse;border-color:rgba(73,40,194,.3)}
.orion-ring:nth-child(3){width:380px;height:380px;top:0;left:-10px;animation-duration:55s;border-color:rgba(91,42,98,.2)}
.orion-core{position:absolute;width:80px;height:80px;background:radial-gradient(circle,var(--magenta),var(--blue));border-radius:50%;top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);box-shadow:0 0 60px rgba(191,64,250,.6),0 0 120px rgba(191,64,250,.2)}
.star-dot{position:absolute;width:4px;height:4px;background:var(--magenta);border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 6px var(--magenta)}
#areas{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto}
.areas-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:1.5rem;margin-top:3rem}
.area-card{background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border:1px solid rgba(191,64,250,.12);border-radius:20px;padding:2rem;transition:transform .3s,border-color .3s,background .3s}
.area-card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);border-color:rgba(191,64,250,.4);background:rgba(191,64,250,.05)}
.area-icon{font-size:2.2rem;margin-bottom:1rem}
.area-name{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--white);margin-bottom:.5rem}
.area-desc{font-size:.875rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--periwinkle);opacity:.65}
#careers{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto}
.career-filters{display:flex;gap:.75rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:2rem 0}
.filter-btn{padding:.5rem 1.2rem;border-radius:100px;border:1px solid rgba(191,64,250,.25);background:transparent;color:var(--periwinkle);font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:.8rem;letter-spacing:.04em;cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s}
.filter-btn.active,.filter-btn:hover{background:var(--magenta);border-color:var(--magenta);color:var(--black)}
.careers-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:1rem}
.career-card{background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border:1px solid rgba(73,40,194,.2);border-radius:14px;padding:1.4rem;transition:all .25s}
.career-card:hover{border-color:var(--blue);background:rgba(73,40,194,.08);transform:translateY(-3px)}
.career-area-tag{font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--magenta);margin-bottom:.5rem;opacity:.8}
.career-name{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;color:var(--white);margin-bottom:.4rem}
.career-duration{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--periwinkle);opacity:.5}

.sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0}
.career-search-wrap{margin:1.5rem 0 1rem;max-width:520px}
.career-search{width:100%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid rgba(191,64,250,.2);border-radius:12px;padding:.9rem 1rem;color:var(--white);font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:.95rem;outline:none}
.career-search:focus{border-color:var(--magenta);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(191,64,250,.08)}
.uni-link{display:inline-block;margin-top:1rem;color:var(--magenta);font-size:.8rem;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
.uni-link:hover{text-decoration:underline}
.source-box{margin-top:2rem;padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;border:1px solid rgba(191,64,250,.18);border-radius:16px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.025);line-height:1.7;font-size:.88rem}
.source-note{margin-top:.5rem;opacity:.55;font-size:.78rem}
@media(max-width:600px){.career-search-wrap{max-width:none}.source-box{padding:1rem}}
#universities{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto}
.uni-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:1.5rem;margin-top:3rem}
.uni-card{background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(91,42,98,.15),rgba(73,40,194,.08));border:1px solid rgba(191,64,250,.15);border-radius:20px;padding:2rem;transition:all .3s}
.uni-card:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);border-color:rgba(191,64,250,.4);box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(191,64,250,.1)}
.uni-sigla{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-size:2.5rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--magenta);line-height:1;margin-bottom:.3rem;opacity:.7}
.uni-name{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1rem;color:var(--white);margin-bottom:.6rem}
.uni-type{display:inline-block;font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:.25rem .7rem;border-radius:100px;margin-bottom:.8rem}
.uni-type.publica{background:rgba(73,40,194,.3);color:#a78bfa}
.uni-type.privada{background:rgba(191,64,250,.15);color:var(--magenta)}
.uni-desc{font-size:.84rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--periwinkle);opacity:.65}
#howto{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto}
.steps{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;margin-top:3rem;position:relative}
.steps::before{content:'';position:absolute;left:28px;top:0;bottom:0;width:1px;background:linear-gradient(to bottom,var(--magenta),var(--blue),transparent)}
.step{display:flex;gap:2rem;align-items:flex-start;padding-bottom:3rem;position:relative}
.step-num{width:56px;height:56px;min-width:56px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--black);border:2px solid var(--magenta);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--magenta);position:relative;z-index:1;box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(191,64,250,.3)}
.step-title{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--white);margin-bottom:.4rem}
.step-text{font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.7;color:var(--periwinkle);opacity:.7}
#test{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center}
.test-box{background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);border:1px solid rgba(191,64,250,.2);border-radius:24px;padding:3rem 2.5rem;margin-top:3rem}
.test-progress-bar{height:3px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-radius:2px;margin-bottom:2.5rem;overflow:hidden}
.test-progress-fill{height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--blue),var(--magenta));border-radius:2px;transition:width .5s ease;width:0%}
.test-question{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--white);margin-bottom:2rem;line-height:1.4;min-height:3.5rem}
.test-options{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.75rem;margin-bottom:2rem}
.test-option{padding:1rem 1.5rem;border:1px solid rgba(191,64,250,.2);border-radius:12px;background:transparent;color:var(--periwinkle);font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:.95rem;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s}
.test-option:hover,.test-option.selected{border-color:var(--magenta);background:rgba(191,64,250,.1);color:var(--white)}
.test-nav{display:flex;gap:1rem;justify-content:center}
.test-result{display:none;animation:fadeUp .6s forwards}
.result-emoji{font-size:3rem;margin-bottom:1rem}
.result-title{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--white);margin-bottom:.5rem}
.result-desc{font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.7;opacity:.75;margin-bottom:1.5rem}
.result-careers{display:flex;gap:.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center}
.result-tag{padding:.4rem 1rem;background:rgba(191,64,250,.15);border:1px solid rgba(191,64,250,.3);border-radius:100px;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--magenta)}
#contact{max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center}
.contact-form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem;margin-top:3rem;text-align:left}
.form-group{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.4rem}
.form-group label{font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--magenta);opacity:.8}
.form-group input,.form-group textarea,.form-group select{background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid rgba(191,64,250,.2);border-radius:10px;padding:.85rem 1rem;color:var(--white);font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:.95rem;outline:none;transition:border-color .2s;appearance:none}
.form-group input:focus,.form-group textarea:focus,.form-group select:focus{border-color:var(--magenta)}
.form-group textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:100px}
.form-group select option{background:#1a1020}
footer{position:relative;z-index:1;padding:3rem 2rem;text-align:center;border-top:1px solid rgba(191,64,250,.1)}
.footer-logo{font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--white);margin-bottom:.5rem}
.footer-logo span{color:var(--magenta)}
.footer-sub{font-size:.8rem;opacity:.4;margin-bottom:2rem}
.footer-links{display:flex;gap:2rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.footer-links a{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--periwinkle);opacity:.5;text-decoration:none;transition:opacity .2s}
.footer-links a:hover{opacity:1}
.footer-bottom{margin-top:2rem;font-size:.75rem;opacity:.3}
.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px);transition:opacity .7s ease,transform .7s ease}
.reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}
@keyframes fadeUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
@keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}
@keyframes spin{from{transform:rotate(0deg)}to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}
@keyframes scrollPulse{0%,100%{opacity:.2;transform:scaleY(.8)}50%{opacity:1;transform:scaleY(1)}}
@keyframes float{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)}50%{transform:translateY(-10px)}}
@media(max-width:768px){
  nav{padding:1rem 1.5rem}
  .nav-links{display:none}
  .hamburger{display:flex}
  #about{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem}
  .about-visual{height:260px}
  .orion-ring:nth-child(3){display:none}
  section{padding:5rem 1.5rem}
  .steps::before{left:24px}
  .step-num{width:48px;height:48px;min-width:48px;font-size:1rem}
  .test-box{padding:2rem 1.5rem}
}
@media(max-width:480px){
  .hero-cta{flex-direction:column;align-items:center}
  .btn-primary,.btn-outline{width:100%;text-align:center}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<canvas id="stars-canvas"></canvas>

<nav id="navbar">
  <div class="nav-logo">Orion<span>Path</span></div>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#hero">Inicio</a></li>
    <li><a href="#areas">Áreas</a></li>
    <li><a href="#careers">Carreras</a></li>
    <li><a href="#universities">Universidades</a></li>
    <li><a href="#howto">¿Cómo ingresar?</a></li>
    <li><a href="#test">Test</a></li>
    <li><a href="#contact">Contacto</a></li>
  </ul>
  <button class="hamburger" id="hamburger" aria-label="Abrir menú" aria-controls="mobileMenu" aria-expanded="false" onclick="toggleMobile()"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
</nav>

<div class="mobile-menu" id="mobileMenu">
  <button class="mobile-close" id="mobileClose" onclick="closeMobile()">✕</button>
  <a href="#hero" onclick="closeMobile()">Inicio</a>
  <a href="#areas" onclick="closeMobile()">Áreas</a>
  <a href="#careers" onclick="closeMobile()">Carreras</a>
  <a href="#universities" onclick="closeMobile()">Universidades</a>
  <a href="#howto" onclick="closeMobile()">¿Cómo ingresar?</a>
  <a href="#test" onclick="closeMobile()">Test Vocacional</a>
  <a href="#contact" onclick="closeMobile()">Contacto</a>
</div>

<section id="hero">
  <p class="hero-eyebrow">Escuela Nacional de Comercio N°1 · Asunción, Paraguay</p>
  <h1 class="hero-title">Tu<br/><span class="accent">camino</span><br/>comienza<br/>aquí.</h1>
  <p class="hero-subtitle">OrionPath es tu guía de orientación vocacional. Explorá carreras, conocé universidades y descubrí hacia dónde apuntan tus estrellas.</p>
  <div class="hero-cta">
    <a href="#test" class="btn-primary">Hacer el test vocacional</a>
    <a href="#careers" class="btn-outline">Explorar carreras</a>
  </div>
  <div class="scroll-indicator"><span></span><div class="scroll-line"></div></div>
</section>

<section>
  <div id="about">
    <div class="about-visual">
      <div class="orion-ring"></div>
      <div class="orion-ring"></div>
      <div class="orion-ring"></div>
      <div class="orion-core"></div>
      <div class="star-dot" style="top:20%;left:15%;animation:float 3s ease-in-out infinite"></div>
      <div class="star-dot" style="top:70%;left:80%;animation:float 4s ease-in-out .5s infinite;width:6px;height:6px"></div>
      <div class="star-dot" style="top:85%;left:20%;animation:float 3.5s ease-in-out 1s infinite"></div>
      <div class="star-dot" style="top:10%;left:75%;animation:float 5s ease-in-out .2s infinite;width:3px;height:3px;opacity:.5"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <p class="section-label">Sobre OrionPath</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Orientación vocacional para la generación digital</h2>
      <div class="divider"></div>
      <p class="section-desc">OrionPath es un proyecto educativo desarrollado por estudiantes de la Especialidad Informática de la ENC1, del 3er curso, diseñado para acompañar a sus compañeros en uno de los momentos más importantes de su vida: la elección de carrera.</p>
      <br/>
      <p class="section-desc">Así como Orión guía a los navegantes en la oscuridad, esta plataforma busca iluminar el camino hacia el futuro académico y profesional de cada estudiante.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div id="areas">
    <div class="reveal">
      <p class="section-label">Áreas de estudio</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">¿Qué te apasiona?</h2>
      <div class="divider"></div>
      <p class="section-desc">Cada persona tiene una inclinación natural. Conocé las grandes áreas del conocimiento y encontrá la tuya.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="areas-grid">
      <div class="area-card reveal"><div class="area-icon">💻</div><div class="area-name">Tecnología e Informática</div><div class="area-desc">Programación, ciberseguridad, inteligencia artificial, redes y desarrollo de software. El área con mayor demanda laboral del siglo XXI.</div></div>
      <div class="area-card reveal"><div class="area-icon">⚕️</div><div class="area-name">Ciencias de la Salud</div><div class="area-desc">Medicina, enfermería, odontología, nutrición y farmacia. Vocaciones orientadas al cuidado y bienestar humano.</div></div>
      <div class="area-card reveal"><div class="area-icon">⚖️</div><div class="area-name">Ciencias Sociales y Jurídicas</div><div class="area-desc">Derecho, ciencias políticas, trabajo social, psicología y comunicación. Transformar la sociedad desde adentro.</div></div>
      <div class="area-card reveal"><div class="area-icon">📊</div><div class="area-name">Administración y Negocios</div><div class="area-desc">Contabilidad, administración de empresas, marketing, comercio internacional y economía.</div></div>
      <div class="area-card reveal"><div class="area-icon">🎨</div><div class="area-name">Arte y Diseño</div><div class="area-desc">Diseño gráfico, arquitectura, comunicación visual, artes plásticas y producción audiovisual.</div></div>
      <div class="area-card reveal"><div class="area-icon">🔬</div><div class="area-name">Ciencias Exactas y Naturales</div><div class="area-desc">Ingeniería, biología, química, física, agronomía y ciencias ambientales. Para mentes analíticas y curiosas.</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div id="careers">
    <div class="reveal">
      <p class="section-label">Carreras universitarias</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Explorá tus opciones</h2>
      <div class="divider"></div>
      <p class="section-desc">Filtrá por área o buscá una carrera. Las duraciones son referenciales: verificá siempre el plan de estudios vigente en la institución.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="career-search-wrap">
      <label for="careerSearch" class="sr-only">Buscar una carrera</label>
      <input id="careerSearch" class="career-search" type="search" placeholder="Buscar una carrera..." oninput="searchCareers(this.value)" autocomplete="off"/>
    </div>
    <div class="career-filters">
      <button class="filter-btn active" onclick="filterCareers('all',this)">Todas</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterCareers('tech',this)">Tecnología</button>
      <button class="filter-btn" onclick="filterCareers('salud',this)">Salud</button>
